"NSMotionUsageDescription" = "Hecate uses motion to detect walking and cycling for automatic journeys, pauses and discovery reminders. Motion is processed on this device.";
"NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription" = "Hecate uses background location for journeys you start, optional automatic journeys and discovery reminders. Automatic journeys temporarily buffer your route and save it after five continuous minutes of walking. Shorter buffers and reminder samples are not saved to your account.";
